exports[`Unit 19 recorded output: linear-vs-nonlinear > matches the authored sample output 1`] = `
"--- linear-vs-nonlinear · seed 1 · difficulty 1
prompt   Is this relation linear or nonlinear?
display  coordinate-plane x -4..4/1 y -4..4/1 points [(−1, 4), (3, 0), (4, 0)] lines [] "Coordinate plane, x-axis −4 to 4 by 1; y-axis −4 to 4 by 1; points (−1, 4), (3, 0), and (4, 0)" [linear-vs-nonlinear]
answer   choice nonlinear
input    choice
hint     Compare the exact rate of change between consecutive points.
choice   nonlinear = Nonlinear
choice   linear = Linear
step 1   Order the points by x-value.   [(−1, 4), (3, 0), (4, 0)]
